page('/','Their first school starts with you','A guided learning journey from baby’s first look onward, with age-guided classes, playful activities and practical support for parents. Free, no sign-up.',`
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="tape-label">WELCOME TO KIDDO.SCHOOL</span><h1>Their first school<br><em>starts with you.</em></h1><p>A playful digital school from birth onward. Explore age-guided classes, hands-on activities, and simple ways to learn together at home.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/newborn/0-6-weeks/high-contrast-cards/" data-tc-today>Start Today’s Class <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/learning-path/">Explore the Learning Path <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="tc-day-hint" data-tc-hint>Start at Class 1 — from birth, or pick your child’s age when you tap.</p></div><div class="scrapbook" aria-label="A peek at our school"><figure class="hero-paper main-paper"><img src="${newbornBase}newborn-high-contrast-face.webp" width="1080" height="1350" alt="Black and white high-contrast smiling face card for newborns, from the Kiddo.school Newborn 1 class" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Class 1: High-contrast cards, from birth.</figcaption></figure><figure class="hero-paper small-paper"><img src="/assets/collage.svg" width="800" height="600" alt="A house and tree made from colourful paper shapes." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Classrooms for bigger kids, too.</figcaption></figure><div class="scribble" aria-hidden="true">a little wonder<br>goes a long way<svg viewBox="0 0 150 70"><path d="M5 10Q80 80 133 17m-3 1-1 22m4-22-23 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div><div class="round-stamp" aria-hidden="true">FROM FIRST LOOK<br><strong>to big<br>ideas.</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="choose-age"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR CHILD’S AGE</span><h2>Start where your child is.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/learning-path/">See the whole path <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="age-choose"><a class="age-card" href="/newborn/"><span class="age-when">Birth–6 months</span><h3>Newborn</h3><p>High-contrast cards and gentle first classes.</p><span class="fc-open">Open newborn classes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="age-card" href="/baby/"><span class="age-when">3–12 months</span><h3>Baby</h3><p>Colors, objects, animal sounds and first words.</p><span class="fc-open">Open baby classes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="age-card" href="/toddler/"><span class="age-when">12 months–2 years</span><h3>Toddler</h3><p>Matching, sorting, sounds, feelings and Circle Time.</p><span class="fc-open">Open toddler classes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="age-card" href="/preschool/3-years/"><span class="age-when">Age 3</span><h3>Preschool</h3><p>Letters, numbers, shapes, colors, opposites, animals, your body with all five senses — and the foods you eat.</p><span class="fc-open">Open preschool classes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="age-card" href="/preschool/4-years/"><span class="age-when">Age 4</span><h3>Preschool</h3><p>Shapes, colors and pencil control — with three shelves of real, playable adventures.</p><span class="fc-open">Open preschool classes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="learning-path"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE REAL CLASSES</span><h2>Real classes, ready right now.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/learning-path/">Open the Learning Path <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="lesson-lede">Twenty-eight classes are ready now, from birth to age five — each one a short, parent-led session with everything you need on the page. Follow the path in order, or jump straight to your child’s stage. <strong>Age ranges are a guide, not a test. Children learn at their own pace.</strong></p><div class="lp-stages">${stages.map(s=>`<a class="lp-stage" href="${s.href}"><span class="fc-age">${s.name}</span><span class="lp-range">${s.age}</span><span class="lp-open" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>`).join('')}<a class="lp-stage" href="/preschool/3-years/"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="lp-range">Age 3</span><span class="lp-open" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="lp-stage" href="/preschool/4-years/"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="lp-range">Age 4</span><span class="lp-open" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="lesson-start"><a class="button" href="/newborn/0-6-weeks/high-contrast-cards/" data-tc-today>Start Today’s Class <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="lesson-start-hint" data-tc-hint>Class 1: High-Contrast Cards — the very first class, from birth.</span></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="how-school-works"><div class="notebook"><span class="eyebrow">HOW OUR SCHOOL WORKS</span><h2>Little classes. Real life. Together.</h2><div class="steps-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Learn</h3><p>A short class on screen: a few cards, one idea, your voice doing the teaching.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Play</h3><p>Tap, find and match. Wrong taps are welcome — there are no scores here.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Practice</h3><p>Try it again in a gentle game — the same idea, a little different, at your child’s pace.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>Off-Screen</h3><p>Every class ends in real life: hunt for red, spot a circle, name it together.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="my-classroom"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">STEP INSIDE SCHOOL</span><h2>My Classroom is open.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/my-classroom/">Open My Classroom <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="lesson-lede">One little room with big ideas: Circle Time on the rug, drawing and tracing at the desk, gentle games at the toy shelf — and a Sticky Notes wall for little notes.</p><div class="fc-stages"><a class="fc-stage lesson-card-link" href="/my-classroom/"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">All ages</span><span class="fc-class">The school room</span></div><h3>My Classroom</h3><p>Your child&rsquo;s desk shows today&rsquo;s class and real progress — and Circle Time, the toy shelf, the School Bag and the Sticky Notes wall are close by.</p><span class="fc-open">Open My Classroom <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></section><section class="section wrap" id="school-community"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR SCHOOL COMMUNITY</span><h2>Little families, big sharing.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/school-community/">Visit the School Community <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="lesson-lede">See what our little learners are making and what families are saying.</p><div class="fc-stages"><a class="fc-stage lesson-card-link" href="/school-community/"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">New</span><span class="fc-class">Our community</span></div><h3>School Community</h3><p>One friendly place for everything families share — reviewed by the school office before it appears.</p><span class="fc-open">Open School Community <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="fc-stage lesson-card-link" href="/art-wall/"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">On the wall</span><span class="fc-class">Artwork</span></div><h3>Our Art Wall</h3><p>Classroom drawings on display, with family artwork joining after a quick review.</p><span class="fc-open">Visit the Art Wall <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="fc-stage lesson-card-link" href="/sticky-note-wall/"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">On the wall</span><span class="fc-class">Little notes</span></div><h3>Sticky Note Wall</h3><p>Short, friendly notes from families — read by the school office before they go up.</p><span class="fc-open">Leave a note <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></section>${writingSection}<section class="section subject-section" id="subjects"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE CLASSROOMS</span><h2>Pick your next adventure.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/subjects/">All subjects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>${subjectsGrid()}</div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="explore-our-school"><span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE OUR SCHOOL</span><h2>Walk around the school.</h2><p class="mw-lede">Two rooms to wander into — a garden to grow in and a library to read in.</p><div class="explore-grid"><a class="explore-card" href="/toddler/2-years/school-garden/"><span class="explore-eyebrow">SCHOOL LOCATION</span><h3>School Garden</h3><p>Real garden lessons and collections: bugs and insects, garden animals and friends, garden flowers, and the things you find outside.</p><span class="text-link">Visit the School Garden <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="explore-card" href="/learning-library/"><span class="explore-eyebrow">SCHOOL LOCATION</span><h3>School Library</h3><p>The school bookshelf. Real picture books, free to read online as often as you like — organized by age and category.</p><span class="text-link">Visit the School Library <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="parents-principal"><div class="tc-note-block tc-parents"><span class="eyebrow">FOR PARENTS</span><h2>You are the teacher.<br>We are the helper.</h2><p>Every class is led by you, in your own words, at your child’s pace. The grown-ups’ guide covers supervision, adaptations and printing — no teaching experience needed.</p><a class="text-link" href="/grown-ups/">Visit the grown-ups’ guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="tc-note-block tc-principal"><span class="eyebrow">FROM THE PRINCIPAL’S OFFICE</span><h2>A short note home.</h2><p class="tc-say">“Five playful minutes together can be enough. Continue the lesson naturally during your day — name the colors you see, count the stairs, wonder about the weather.”</p><p class="tc-who">— The Principal, Kiddo.school</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/#principal">More from the Principal’s Office <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="final-cta"><span class="eyebrow">START WHERE YOU ARE</span><h2>Ready for today’s class?</h2><p>Two to five playful minutes, wherever you are — today’s class is one tap away.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/newborn/0-6-weeks/high-contrast-cards/" data-tc-today>Start Today’s Class <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/learning-path/">Explore the Learning Path <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>`);
