page('/newborn/','Newborn learning classes: high-contrast cards and more','Free newborn classes for parents: high-contrast black and white cards, faces and gentle sound activities for babies from birth. Two to five calm minutes at a time.',crumb([['Baby','/baby/'],['Newborn']])+heading('NEWBORN LEARNING','First classes for brand-new eyes and ears.','Newborn classes on Kiddo.school are short, high-contrast and parent-led: one card, one sound, one quiet moment at a time.')+newbornBody());
page('/newborn/0-6-weeks/','Baby classes 0–6 weeks: Newborn 1','What to do with a newborn from 0 to 6 weeks: short high-contrast card classes for vision, bonding and sound, made for calm everyday moments at home.',crumb([['Baby','/baby/'],['Newborn','/newborn/'],['0–6 Weeks']])+heading('NEWBORN 1','Birth–6 weeks: bold shapes, soft voice.','The very first Kiddo.school class. High-contrast cards for vision, bonding and sound, in two-to-five-minute moments that fit around feeds and naps.')+weeksBody());
page('/subjects/see/','See: baby visual activities by subject','The See subject collects Kiddo.school classes that support your baby’s visual development: high-contrast cards, tracking games and face time, from birth onward.',crumb([['Subjects','/subjects/'],['See']])+heading('THE SEE SUBJECT','Look together, one card at a time.','See is the subject behind your baby’s visual world: noticing bold shapes, focusing, following with their eyes and meeting your face.')+seeBody());
