page('/baby/6-9-months/','Baby classes 6–9 months: Explorer 1','What to do with a baby at 6 to 9 months: animal and everyday-object flashcards with animal sounds, pointing and simple naming, in short parent-led Talk & Think sessions.',crumb([['Baby','/baby/'],['6–9 Months']])+heading('EXPLORER 1','6–9 months: animals, objects and thinking together.','The Explorer 1 class. Around this age babies recognise familiar pictures, love animal sounds and start to remember what they have seen, so this lesson pairs animals and everyday objects with simple naming and sound play.')+stagePageBody({chips:[['Age','6–9 Months'],['Class','Explorer 1'],['Subjects','Talk, thinking, recognition']],stageLessons:[aeoLesson],subject:'Talk &amp; Think',soon:`<div class="fc-stage lesson-soon"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Earlier stage</span><span class="fc-class">4–6 Months</span></div><h3>Start with Infant 2</h3><p>First words and familiar things live at <a href="/baby/4-6-months/">4–6 months · Infant 2</a>.</p></div>`}));
page('/subjects/talk-and-think/','Talk & Think: baby language and thinking activities by subject','The Talk & Think subject collects Kiddo.school classes that grow early language and thinking together: naming animals and everyday objects, playing with sounds and building early recognition, from 6 months onward.',crumb([['Subjects','/subjects/'],['Talk & Think']])+heading('THE TALK &amp; THINK SUBJECT','Name it, sound it, spot it again.','Talk &amp; Think is the subject where language and little thoughts grow together: your voice names what your baby sees, animal sounds add play, and seeing the same pictures again builds early recognition. Every Talk &amp; Think class is short, calm and designed to be led by you.')+talkThinkBody());
