page('/baby/9-12-months/','Baby classes 9–12 months: Explorer 2','What to do with a baby at 9 to 12 months: body-part and action flashcards with copy-me play — clapping, waving and pointing — in short parent-led Talk & Think sessions.',crumb([['Baby','/baby/'],['9–12 Months']])+heading('EXPLORER 2','9–12 months: body parts, actions and copy-me play.','The Explorer 2 class. Around this age babies recognise familiar pictures, love actions they can copy and enjoy it when you name what they are doing, so this lesson pairs body parts and everyday actions with simple words and movement.')+stagePageBody({chips:[['Age','9–12 Months'],['Class','Explorer 2'],['Subjects','Talk, thinking, movement']],stageLessons:[fabLesson],subject:'Talk &amp; Think',soon:`<div class="fc-stage lesson-soon"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Earlier stage</span><span class="fc-class">6–9 Months</span></div><h3>Start with Explorer 1</h3><p>Animals and everyday objects live at <a href="/baby/6-9-months/">6–9 months · Explorer 1</a>.</p></div>`}));
